        portDut = peer.portDut
        stk_a = self.testSet.stk_a
        # Establish an SSH server with a valid allow-listed user (used to prove other
        # sessions remain unaffected by the rejected intruder login), while the
        # intruder username used in main() is never created anywhere on the DUT nor
        # added to the allow-users list.
